 it worth living. \nExperience this excitement and amazement through a roller coaster ride in a fantasy world full of cakes, candies and ice-creams.\nMouth-watering candy sticks and lollipops simply enhance the sweetness of this VR Roller coaster ride. \nEver wondered how fun-filled it would be living in candy houses and recieving fabulous surprises? \nHold your breath and get ready for an exciting trip in the VR World. Take a bath in the  candy fountains and relish the upbeat music as an icing on the cake.\nAdventure has never been so sweet before!", "short_description": "Experience this roller coaster ride in a fantasy world full of cakes, candies, ice-creams and lollipops. Explore the world where you find cute creatures living in candy houses. With breath-taking twists and turns, upbeat music and many surprises, this trip to Candy VR world awaits you!"}]}, "developer_name": "Timeloop Technologies", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://candycoaster.timeloop.in/privacy_policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://candycoaster.timeloop.in/terms_of_service.html", "publisher_name": "Timeloop Technologies Pvt. Ltd.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://candycoaster.timeloop.in/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "SIMULATION", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "649239296403338"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_bi